{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Cart Budget Calculator 是一款專注購物預算的計算工具，適合到超市、家庭用品店或選購禮物時使用。你只需設定購物預算，再逐項加入商品價格，畫面便會即時顯示剩餘金額，幫助你在結帳前判斷下一個項目是否仍符合上限。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-282.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>即時掌握剩餘購物預算</h2>\n<p>設定購物預算後，把每件放入購物車的商品價格逐一加入，App 會同步更新剩餘金額，讓你清楚知道下一個項目是否仍在上限之內。無論日常雜貨、家庭用品或禮物選購，都能用同一個清晰數字輔助判斷。它不需連接銀行，也不提供消費紀錄或財務儀錶板，只聚焦結帳前最實用的剩餘購物預算。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-297-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-298-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-299-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-300-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-301-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Cart Budget Calculator</li><li>應用類別：Shopping</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cart-budget-calculator/id6802814389?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:55:06.857420+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:47.897331+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:30.890690+00:00","content_hash":"d88b231a195dfe0d19f26f3581412ae8b23b548a0955d967c475d4f7c10bc16c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}